<!doctype html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><meta name="robots" content="noindex,nofollow"><title>Chinese 3 · Paper A · Optional preparation</title><base href="/api/v1/course-tests/chinese-3/a/file/"><link rel="stylesheet" href="paper.css"></head><body><main><header class="hero"><p class="eyebrow">HSKKit · Chinese 3 Course Review · Original Paper A</p><h1>Optional preparation</h1><p>40 objective questions + 4 writing/speaking tasks · 90-minute section budget.</p><p class="note">Reference materials. Open the workspace for section clocks, local answer saving and recording. Writing and speaking need self-review or your own teacher; no automatic grade.</p><nav class="links"><a href="index.html">Overview</a><a href="student.html">Learner paper</a><a href="student-traditional.html">繁體試卷</a><a href="teacher.html">Answers &amp; scripts</a><a href="listening.html">Listen to Chinese 3 A</a><a href="student.pdf">Learner PDF</a><a href="student-traditional.pdf">繁體 PDF</a><a href="teacher.pdf">Answer PDF</a></nav></header><section class="box"><p>Optional before-practice support. No pinyin is shown in the learner paper. This is an author-selected list, not a complete calibrated word list.</p><p class="cn">志愿活动 <span class="note">volunteer activity</span></p><p class="cn">介绍板 <span class="note">display board</span></p><p class="cn">群消息 <span class="note">group-chat messages</span></p><p class="cn">分工 <span class="note">division of tasks</span></p><p class="cn">报名 <span class="note">sign up</span></p><p class="cn">校园广播 <span class="note">school radio</span></p><p class="cn">摄影 <span class="note">photography</span></p><p class="cn">录音 <span class="note">record audio</span></p><p class="cn">采访 <span class="note">interview</span></p><p class="cn">封面 <span class="note">cover</span></p><p class="cn">修补 <span class="note">mend</span></p><p class="cn">提手 <span class="note">handle</span></p><p class="cn">堆放 <span class="note">pile up</span></p><p class="cn">匆忙 <span class="note">hurried</span></p><p class="cn">从容 <span class="note">unhurried</span></p><p class="cn">长跑 <span class="note">distance running</span></p><p class="cn">闷着 <span class="note">keep feelings to oneself</span></p><p class="cn">名次 <span class="note">placing in a competition</span></p><p class="cn">实验教室 <span class="note">science classroom</span></p><p class="cn">楼层图 <span class="note">floor plan</span></p><p class="cn">校刊 <span class="note">school magazine</span></p><p class="cn">保安 <span class="note">security guard</span></p><p class="cn">新生 <span class="note">new student</span></p><p class="cn">合唱 <span class="note">choir</span></p><p class="cn">排队 <span class="note">queue</span></p><p class="cn">漏掉 <span class="note">leave out</span></p><p class="cn">剪辑 <span class="note">video editing</span></p><p class="cn">设备 <span class="note">equipment</span></p><p class="cn">图书角 <span class="note">classroom reading corner</span></p><p class="cn">推荐单 <span class="note">recommendation list</span></p><p class="cn">定稿 <span class="note">finalize</span></p><p class="cn">栏目 <span class="note">programme segment</span></p><p class="cn">目录 <span class="note">table of contents</span></p><p class="cn">相册 <span class="note">photo album</span></p><p class="cn">模糊 <span class="note">blurred</span></p><p class="cn">缺页 <span class="note">missing pages</span></p><p class="cn">同龄人 <span class="note">people of the same age</span></p><p class="cn">一次性 <span class="note">single-use</span></p><p class="cn">指定 <span class="note">designated</span></p><p class="cn">确认 <span class="note">check/confirm</span></p><p class="cn">观察 <span class="note">observe</span></p><p class="cn">埋怨 <span class="note">blame/complain about</span></p><p class="cn">反馈 <span class="note">feedback</span></p></section></main></body></html>